      "topic": "complex_numbers_roots_of_quadratic",
      "topicKh": "ចំនួនកុំផ្លិច — ស្វែងរក a, b ពីឫស x₁=1+i√3",
      "chunkType": "worked_example",
      "responsePatternIds": ["khmer-math-textbook-solution"],
      "text": "x₁ = 1+i√3 ជាឫស x²+ax+b=0 ។ ស្វែងរក a, b ។\nx₁²+ax₁+b=0 ⟺ (1+i√3)²+a(1+i√3)+b=0\n⟺ (1+2i√3-3)+(a+ai√3)+b=0\n⟺ (-2+a+b)+(2√3+a√3)i=0\n⟹ 2√3+a√3=0 ⟹ a=-2 ; -2+a+b=0 ⟹ b=4 ។",
      "normalizedText": "Find a, b such that x₁=1+i√3 is a root of x²+ax+b=0. Substitute x₁, expand, separate real/imaginary parts, solve system: a=-2, b=4.",
      "problem": {
        "textKh": "x₁=1+i√3 ជាឫស x²+ax+b=0 ; a,b ∈ ℝ ។ ស្វែងរក a, b",
        "text": "x₁=1+i√3 is a root of x²+ax+b=0 with real a,b. Find a and b.",
        "latex": "x_1 = 1+i\\sqrt{3} \\text{ is root of } x^2+ax+b=0"
      },
      "solutionSteps": [
        {
          "textKh": "ជំនួស x₁ ទៅក្នុងសមីការ: x₁²+ax₁+b=0:",
          "text": "Substitute x₁ into the equation:",
          "latex": "(1+i\\sqrt{3})^2 + a(1+i\\sqrt{3}) + b = 0",
          "explanationKh": "(1+i√3)² = 1+2i√3-3 = -2+2i√3",
          "explanation": "(1+i√3)² = -2+2i√3"
        },
        {
          "textKh": "បង្រួម ហើយបំបែកផ្នែកពិត/ស្មុគស្មាញ:",
          "text": "Expand and separate real and imaginary parts:",
          "latex": "(-2+a+b) + (2\\sqrt{3}+a\\sqrt{3})i = 0",
          "explanationKh": "ភាគពិត: -2+a+b=0 ; ភាគស្មុគស្មាញ: (2+a)√3=0",
          "explanation": "Real part: -2+a+b=0; imaginary part: (2+a)√3=0"
        },
        {
          "textKh": "ដោះស្រាយ: a=-2 ⟹ b=4",
          "text": "Solve: from imaginary part a=-2, then real part gives b=4",
          "latex": "a = -2 \\;\\;;\\;\\; b = 4",
          "explanationKh": "2+a=0 ⟹ a=-2 ; -2+(-2)+b=0 ⟹ b=4",
          "explanation": "From 2√3+a√3=0: a=-2. Then -2-2+b=0: b=4"
        }
      ],
      "finalAnswer": {
        "textKh": "ដូចេ្នះ a=-2, b=4 ។ សមីការ x²-2x+4=0",
        "text": "a=-2, b=4. Equation is x²-2x+4=0.",
        "latex": "a=-2,\\quad b=4"
      },
      "formulas": [],
      "keywords": ["complex root", "quadratic", "coefficients", "ឫស", "ចំនួនកុំផ្លិច"],
