      "topic": "complex_numbers_quotient_trig_form",
      "topicKh": "ចំនួនកុំផ្លិច — Z=(x₁/x₂)² ទ្រង់ទ្រាយត្រីកោណ",
      "chunkType": "worked_example",
      "responsePatternIds": ["khmer-math-textbook-solution"],
      "text": "x²-2x+4=0 ⟹ x₁=1+i√3, x₂=1-i√3 ។\nx₁=2(cos π/3 + i sin π/3) ; x₂=2(cos(-π/3)+i sin(-π/3)) ។\nZ=(x₁/x₂)² = [(cos(π/3-(-π/3))+i sin(π/3-(-π/3)))]² = (cos(2π/3)+i sin(2π/3))²\n= cos(4π/3)+i sin(4π/3) ។",
      "normalizedText": "From x²-2x+4=0 with roots x₁=1+i√3=2(cos π/3+i sin π/3) and x₂=1-i√3=2(cos(-π/3)+i sin(-π/3)). Compute Z=(x₁/x₂)² using trig division then De Moivre. Result: Z=cos(4π/3)+i sin(4π/3).",
      "problem": {
        "textKh": "ស្វែង x₂ ឫសទីពីរ ។ គណនា Z=(x₁/x₂)² ជ្រុបទ្រង់ត្រីកោណ",
        "text": "Find x₂ (other root of x²-2x+4=0) and compute Z=(x₁/x₂)² in trig form.",
        "latex": "Z = \\left(\\frac{x_1}{x_2}\\right)^2"
      },
      "solutionSteps": [
        {
          "textKh": "x₂=conjugate(x₁)=1-i√3 ។ ទ្រង់ទ្រាយត្រីកោណ:",
          "text": "x₂=1-i√3 (conjugate). Trig forms:",
          "latex": "x_1=2\\!\\left(\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{3}+i\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right),\\quad x_2=2\\!\\left(\\cos\\frac{-\\pi}{3}+i\\sin\\frac{-\\pi}{3}\\right)",
          "explanationKh": "|x₁|=|x₂|=2 ; arg(x₁)=π/3 ; arg(x₂)=-π/3",
          "explanation": "Both have modulus 2; arguments are ±π/3"
        },
        {
          "textKh": "ចែក x₁/x₂ — ចែក modulus, ដក argument:",
          "text": "Divide x₁/x₂ (moduli cancel, subtract arguments):",
          "latex": "\\frac{x_1}{x_2} = \\cos\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}-\\frac{-\\pi}{3}\\right)+i\\sin\\!\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}-\\frac{-\\pi}{3}\\right) = \\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{3}+i\\sin\\frac{2\\pi}{3}",
          "explanationKh": "modulus: 2/2=1 ; argument: π/3-(-π/3)=2π/3",
          "explanation": "Modulus ratio is 1, argument difference is 2π/3"
        },
        {
          "textKh": "De Moivre ដើម្បីការ²:",
          "text": "Square using De Moivre:",
          "latex": "Z = \\left(\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{3}+i\\sin\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\right)^2 = \\cos\\frac{4\\pi}{3}+i\\sin\\frac{4\\pi}{3}",
          "explanationKh": "(cosθ+i sinθ)² = cos2θ+i sin2θ",
          "explanation": "Double the angle"
        }
      ],
      "finalAnswer": {
        "textKh": "x₂=1-i√3 ; Z=cos(4π/3)+i sin(4π/3)",
        "text": "x₂=1-i√3; Z=cos(4π/3)+i sin(4π/3)",
        "latex": "x_2=1-i\\sqrt{3}\\;\\;;\\;\\; Z = \\cos\\frac{4\\pi}{3}+i\\sin\\frac{4\\pi}{3}"
      },
      "formulas": [
        {
          "latex": "\\left(\\frac{r_1(\\cos\\theta_1+i\\sin\\theta_1)}{r_2(\\cos\\theta_2+i\\sin\\theta_2)}\\right)^n = \\left(\\frac{r_1}{r_2}\\right)^n\\!\\bigl(\\cos n(\\theta_1-\\theta_2)+i\\sin n(\\theta_1-\\theta_2)\\bigr)",
          "meaning": "ការចែក + De Moivre ផ្ដលំនៅ",
          "confidence": 1.0
        }
      ],
      "keywords": ["De Moivre", "complex quotient", "trig form", "conjugate", "ទ្រង់ទ្រាយត្រីកោណ"],
