          "latex": "= \\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\dfrac{\\sin x}{x} + \\dfrac{e^x-1}{x}}{\\dfrac{x^2+x}{x}} = \\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{\\dfrac{\\sin x}{x}+\\dfrac{e^x-1}{x}}{x+1}",
